    "rationale": "At 18 h, diluted readings corrected for dilution are above the undiluted reading of 1.209: 10x gives 0.135 ×10 = 1.35 (replicates 0.1325, 0.1375) and 20x gives 0.0645 ×20 = 1.29 (replicates 0.061, 0.068). At 12 h, the 10x reading corrects to 1.205, which matches the undiluted 1.22, so the reader agrees with the dilutions at that time. Biomass therefore seems to keep rising after 12 h while the undiluted readings stay flat near 1.2, which fits the reader saturating near its top. The excess is modest (about 7–12%), and the 20x replicates are noisy."
